# Unity generated folders — matched at any depth so the project folder can be
# named anything (Game, cityGame, ...) without silently committing Library/.
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/
.vs/
.vsconfig
*.csproj
*.sln
*.user

# agent loop output
agent/build/
agent/logs/
agent/shots/

# The Unity project folder (Game, cityGame, whatever you named it) is a working copy: its
# Assets are synced from unity/Assets by loop.ps1 and generated by Editor/ProjectSetup. Track
# the project definition — ProjectSettings and Packages — never the copy.
# The leading /*/ anchors this to a subfolder, so unity/Assets itself stays tracked.
/*/Assets/
/*/Assets.meta
